ins.\", \"evidence\": \"Task 4 card in Completed view: 'Complete tax filing | High | Gather all documents... | Sep 10 | Prerequisite \\\"Review project proposal\\\" incomplete'; completeState=completed, completeDisabled=true, editDisabled=true, titleLineThrough=line-through.\"}, {\"item_id\": \"IX-18\", \"verdict\": \"FAIL\", \"issue\": \"Dashed dependency connection lines are not hoverable; no dependency-chain popup appears\", \"actual\": \"The SVG holding the dashed connectors has computed pointer-events:none and z-index:0 and is painted behind the task cards. document.elementFromPoint at the midpoint of all 3 connection paths returns task-card DIVs, never the connection path, so the mouse can never reach the line's hover target. Real Playwright hover on the visible dashed connector stub (.bg-dashed-line) produced 0 tooltips and 0 \\\"Dependency Chain\\\" nodes. Playwright also refuses to hover the paths themselves (zero-width bounding box / \\\"element is not visible\\\").\", \"evidence\": \"svg class=\\\"absolute top-0 left-0 w-full h-full pointer-events-none z-0\\\"; elementFromPoint hits: DIV.bg-dashed-line, DIV.flex-1, DIV.bg-dashed-line. Warning-badge tooltip works, so tooltip machinery exists but is not reachable from the connection.\"}, {\"item_id\": \"IX-20\", \"verdict\": \"PASS\", \"issue\": null, \"actual\": null, \"evidence\": \"Hovering tasks.list.item.7.blocked-warning (\\\"2 prerequisites incomplete\\\") opens tooltip: \\\"Dependency Chain / Review project proposal - pending / Complete tax filing - pending\\\", naming pending prerequisites.\"}, {\"item_id\": \"CT-21\", \"verdict\": \"PASS\", \"issue\": null, \"actual\": null, \"evidence\": \"Cards show title+priority always (e.g. \\\"Undated simple task | Medium\\\" with no desc/deadline), description+deadline when supplied (\\\"Complete tax filing | High | Gather all documents... | Sep 10\\\"), blocked state via warning badge + dashed warning border (bg-muted/30 border-dashed border-warning/40). C